   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 0,
   "cooked": "<p>We definitely need to look at all the convictions voting parameters together…</p>\n<p>A low Max Ratio slow down our spending with CV… but a low half life will counter act that…</p>\n<p>I am very excited to see these params modeled so we can really see how all these parameters interact</p>",
