   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>I’d like to share some tools that will allow us to select beta and min threshold parameters.</p>\n<p>We have an interactive graph on how much conviction is required depending on the funds requested. Tweaking beta (β) and min threshold (M) we can see how much conviction is needed.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/564aa1341478772d3329d05983017e1d5db62165.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"192\" height=\"192\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.desmos.com/calculator/yuv0nsv1jz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Desmos</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/690f5449a4f18939b7f7ec499039e5a92ef61f3f.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.desmos.com/calculator/yuv0nsv1jz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Trigger</a></h3>\n\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>We can also see how much conviction is gathered during time in this other interactive graph, in which you can interact with the three parameters: half-life, beta and min threshold.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/564aa1341478772d3329d05983017e1d5db62165.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"192\" height=\"192\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.desmos.com/calculator/5xvr9lhrhl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Desmos</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/2b80fbc5882b60898c43ada116a43aef406e617c.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.desmos.com/calculator/5xvr9lhrhl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Conviction + Threshold</a></h3>\n\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
